            "\n",
            "\\paragraph{Hard Prompt (HP)} uses the description of control attributes as the hard prompt. Each attribute is formed as ``Attribute: Value'', where ``Attribute'' can be ``Topic, Speaker, Length, Extractiveness, Specificity'', and ``Value'' is the corresponding value (e.g., High or Normal) of the attribute. We concatenate 5 control attributes using ``;'' and prepend it to the input source.\n",
